[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18120.07, "timestamp": "05:02:00", "text": "某物。呃，就是那个东西。我不需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18124.27, "timestamp": "05:02:04", "text": "它。步枪吊舱。让我们继续"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18128.27, "timestamp": "05:02:08", "text": "那。呃，我应该扔掉哪些东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18131.19, "timestamp": "05:02:11", "text": "呃，我的一部分想法是想把木头扔掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18134.27, "timestamp": "05:02:14", "text": "但这很重要。但，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18136.708, "timestamp": "05:02:16", "text": "哦，你知道吗？让我们把……扔掉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18139.35, "timestamp": "05:02:19", "text": "倾向。我认为我们不需要它。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18141.35, "timestamp": "05:02:21", "text": "但这很重要。这就是我的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18144.07, "timestamp": "05:02:24", "text": "把它挑起来。好了，我们得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18145.59, "timestamp": "05:02:25", "text": "一切。我认为我们洗劫了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18148.708, "timestamp": "05:02:28", "text": "一切。现在，我们需要走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18164.708, "timestamp": "05:02:44", "text": "燃料。哦，等等。我们难道不需要柴油吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18167.31, "timestamp": "05:02:47", "text": "还是别的什么？糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18171.27, "timestamp": "05:02:51", "text": "呃，有点想把这木头扔掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18172.43, "timestamp": "05:02:52", "text": "东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18175.19, "timestamp": "05:02:55", "text": "呃，哦，等等。应该有一个"}]